# Production build flags. Committed on purpose — Vercel reads it at build time.
# Secrets do NOT belong here; REACT_APP_SUPABASE_* come from Vercel's
# Environment Variables (and from .env locally).

# CRA emits ~12 MB of .map files by default and Vercel serves them from the
# CDN, which publishes the full readable source of an internal tool and makes
# every deploy that much heavier. Browsers only fetch them with DevTools open,
# so turning them off costs users nothing.
# Set to true temporarily if you need to debug a production stack trace.
GENERATE_SOURCEMAP=false
